# Generated artifacts — genwork holds the offline probe's seeded
# workdirs (regenerated on demand); they are large and expendable.
genwork/

# Generated corpus instances are artifacts — `crush eval gen`
# reproduces any cell deterministically. The exception: the s001
# draws are the paid manifests' pinned corpus cells, tracked so the
# manifests' corpus globs resolve against committed content.
corpus/gen-*
!corpus/gen-*-s001-*
